====== CloudEngines Pogoplug v4/mobile ======

The Pogoplug Mobile (POGO-V4-**A1**-01) and Pogoplug Series 4 (POGO-V4-**A3**-01) are low-cost backup and media sharing devices based on the Marvell Kirkwood (ARM) CPU. The Pogoplug Mobile is notable for its low cost (< $10 USD).

[[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?id=51769|OpenWrt forum thread: Pogoplug Mobile - Potentially the Best OpenWrt Platform @ $10 shipped]]

