According to [[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?id=51769|this forum thread]], the steps for installing OpenWrt on the Pogoplug Mobile (and booting from USB) are:

  - Follow [[http://blog.qnology.com/2014/07/hacking-pogoplug-v4-series-4-and-mobile.html|this guide]] **up to** (and including) the step "Boot default Pogoplug OS when USB/SD Card not attached (optional)"
